WEBVTT

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.490
Shinobu...?

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.190
I'm certain...

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.000
that I felt something 
hamper my sword just now.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:32.890
Kagetsu?

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.260
Kagetsu...?

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:48.020
Compassion

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:23.610
Twin Moons

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.050
Your gem...!

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:28.130
I've never seen it 
glow like this before.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.470
Devotion

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:45.750
Duty

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:49.020
Shinobu!

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:52.020
That was so foolish of you, Shinobu!

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:54.560
The poor boy.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:56.870
You just had to interfere and

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:59.350
keep him from returning 
the other half to Kagetsu.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.790
With a wound like that, 
he's as good as dead.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:06.410
Having said that, I 
want you to hand over

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.200
the kid's body along with his gem.

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:09.410
Stay back!

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:10.830
You bastard!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.920
You were after Shinobu and the gem 
since the beginning, weren't you?

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:17.890
Did you know that the 
gem was inside of him?

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:20.670
Did you attack him, 
knowing where it was?!

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.110
Hey, now.

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:23.980
Don't go backing out on our deal.

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.060
I was supposed to get that gem in 
exchange for breaking the barrier.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.320
Silence!

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:52.260
I swear, he is a super-doting parent.

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:54.530
I never would have dreamed that

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:57.100
the gem was hidden inside 
of the boy's body.

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:00.210
That was your doing, I presume?

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:29.030
Compassion

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:31.790
Are you absolutely sure 
about this, Hazuki?

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:33.680
Yeah.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:36.660
Why didn't you relinquish that ball

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.400
to the man and be rid of him?

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:41.210
Having failed to keep 
your end of the bargain,

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.340
that man will most 
assuredly come after you.

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.720
Kagetsu told me about how Shinobu

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.800
was holding an eerie ball 
when he found the boy.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:53.260
I suspect that Kagetsu was the one 
who hid it in Shinobu's body...

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:56.290
...along with half of 
his own life force.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:58.810
I won't let that man have it!

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.880
But can you defeat that man 
when he comes to fight you?

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:05.610
Especially in your current condition,

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.070
having given half of 
your life to Shinobu?

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.830
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.800
Are you stupid or what?!

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.080
What brought that on?

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:15.920
Why did you have to copy Kagetsu?!

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.190
You gave your own life...

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.190
to someone like me...

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:24.020
That's what got Kagetsu killed!

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.440
It's what any parent would do.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:31.290
Kagetsu was your father.

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:33.970
He didn't want to linger in this world

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.150
at the cost of his own son's life.

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:39.100
I feel the same.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.320
Hazuki...

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:45.610
I... I've done it again...!

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:53.370
Shino, the sun is almost down.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.810
The way my gem started to glow...

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:57.870
I bet it was resounding 
with the eighth gem.

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:00.150
Something may have happened to Shinobu.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:02.890
That would mean that Shinobu

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:04.380
truly does possess the final gem...

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:11.770
What's wrong?

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.140
Aren't all of these your favorites?

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:19.780
I thought...

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:23.410
...that it would be all 
right if I stayed here.

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:36.610
After all, I wasn't welcome 
anywhere on the...

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.120
other side.

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:52.020
This is where I belong and I 
have Kagetsu to thank for that.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.050
But it's my fault that he...!

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:59.640
I bring misfortune to those I'm with...

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:03.060
Both Mom and Kagetsu...!

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.000
Why did you save me?!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.070
Why didn't you let me die back there?!

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:26.960
If Kagetsu heard you say 
that, I know he'd cry.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:34.690
Shinobu...

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:38.600
Kagetsu...

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:41.100
It tears me apart, too.

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.170
Hazuki...

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:52.490
Hazuki...!

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.250
He broke my barrier!

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.130
He's trying to force 
us out into the open!

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:17.890
I need you to keep your 
end of the bargain.

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:19.390
I refuse!

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:23.150
Well, I truly hate to do this, but...

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:41.410
Hazuki!

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.790
Get back, Shinobu!

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.550
Shino!

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:00.060
Hazuki!

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:03.060
Stay back! This is nothing 
more than a scratch!

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:05.810
I'm taking that vessel!

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:35.190
Damn!

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:38.340
Well, Jeez! I suppose that 
will have to go on hold.

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.240
The fire is getting worse by the second!

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.050
What're they doing?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.000
Hazuki, are you all right?

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.360
Yeah, it's nothing serious.

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:57.300
Natsume, look after Shinobu.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:00.420
He is our clan's last child.

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:01.620
Very well.

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:03.010
Hazuki!

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:03.830
Shinobu...

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.060
I know that I just brought 
you back to the mountain,

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.130
but you should return 
to that human village.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:12.040
How could you say that?!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.480
It's only a matter of time

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:15.700
before this fire consumes 
the entire mountain.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:16.690
No...

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:20.140
This mountain... is no longer your home!

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:26.370
But so long as you take 
pride in who you are,

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:29.170
no matter where you go, 
that is where you belong.

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:31.620
Kagetsu and I will be there with you!

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:33.140
That's not what I want!

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:34.150
I'm staying here with you.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.150
I'm staying with you, Hazuki!

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:40.500
I never expected to hear 
that from you the way

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.420
you always went on about Kagetsu.

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:45.480
Did living with the humans 
bring about this change?

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.070
It looks like a bit 
of good may have come

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:50.580
from the time you spent 
as a human child...

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.470
Hazuki...

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:54.930
You've matured.

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:56.920
I'm not a child anymore!

00:10:57.350 --> 00:10:58.670
You are a child.

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:02.800
You're the precious child my 
brother and I raised together...

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:04.230
In that case,

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:08.210
there must be something that a 
child can do for his parents!

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:10.600
I still haven't done anything!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.810
So I can't just leave you behind!

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.070
Live!

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:20.470
Never try to die before me 
- your parent - ever again!

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:21.960
Hazuki...

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:27.200
Go!

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.050
Hazuki!

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:33.710
No! Hazuki!

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.710
Hazuki!

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.510
Isn't this for the best, Kagetsu?

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:52.180
Why are those birds 
diving into the fire?

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:53.660
That is where their master is.

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:55.690
So they're going to protect him.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.780
Doesn't that mean Shinobu 
is also over there?

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:01.300
Shino!

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:04.980
Natsume, let go! Hazuki is-!

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:06.980
I am following none other 
than Hazuki's orders.

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:09.030
He said to take you to a human village.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:12.230
Don't give me that crap! 
I can't just leave Hazuki!

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:13.860
Lemme go, dammit!

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:15.760
Hey, quit wiggling around!

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:27.530
Wings...?

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:29.390
Whoa!

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.650
How am I supposed to work these things?!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.140
Kagetsu...

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.250
Don't worry.

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:50.090
He's going to resume life 
amongst the humans,

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:52.660
taking everything we had 
to offer with him...

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.470
He was a child born

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:59.020
between a human and a 
Tengu, just as I was...

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:03.490
Kagetsu, it turned out 
just as you predicted.

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:06.550
"Our clan loves human children."

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:08.240
"That is our fate."

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:12.250
"And eventually, we shall 
return to being humans."

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:27.680
Now there is nothing... 
left for me to worry about.

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.600
Considering how you 
aren't trying to flee,

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.290
I take it you've consumed all 
of your powers as a Tengu.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.290
Where is the gem?

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:44.900
I don't know.

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:49.980
How pathetic!

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.990
This is what happens when 
the great Tengu Chief

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.440
saves the life of a measly human child.

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:57.450
You could never understand!

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:00.700
I'd be willing to surrender 
my life at any given moment

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.730
if that's what it took to 
save someone I held dear!

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:17.650
Stop it...! Stop it, you guys!

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:20.640
Stop it!

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:41.250
Hazuki... Kagetsu...!

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:44.400
But so long as you take 
pride in who you are,

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:48.330
no matter where you go, 
that is where you belong.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:55.080
The place where... I belong!

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:15.140
I will protect... my home!

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:20.990
Shino, the fire will make its 
way here before much longer!

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:22.500
Let's pull back!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.690
Not an option!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:25.560
Shinobu is trying his 
darnedest by himself.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:26.190
Huh?

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:27.600
I can sense him!

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.700
He's somewhere up ahead.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:38.750
My shadow...

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:00.740
Damn it!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.450
Shino?! And Sosuke?

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:08.330
I've never actually covered 
an area this huge before,

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:10.330
but, hey, it's worth a shot!

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:11.710
Murasame!

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:13.780
Roger!

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:26.320
Murasame, let us see 
your power in action.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:32.510
What's with that katana...?

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:46.190
Don't just stand there! Gimme some wind!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:47.630
Uh-huh!

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.600
From the looks of it, the 
fire should die out soon.

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:19.490
Shinobu!

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:23.400
Thank goodness you're still alive!

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:24.570
Natsume!

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:27.570
Looks like we can add another 
weirdo to the list...

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:29.010
Indeed.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:42.200
Hazuki...

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:44.760
Hazuki!

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:57.290
Hazuki...?

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.220
Damn it!

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:07.310
I... In the end,

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:10.590
I failed to save Hazuki!

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:13.750
How could he call me a Tengu child?

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:18.040
I couldn't accomplish anything!

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.240
That's not true!

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:24.850
Take a look around ya.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:38.010
You managed to protect 
this mountain, didn't you?

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:43.710
Live!

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:57.280
Duty

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.760
Sorry!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:02.030
Duty

00:18:57.760 --> 00:19:01.160
I wasn't able to retrieve the 
gem and vessel you desired.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.130
You are such a naughty boy!

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:06.070
Didn't I press that you must be careful

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:07.740
when dealing with that Tengu?

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:09.540
However...

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:11.540
This is such a pretty child!

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:18.760
It looks like that water works well 
on beings from the other side.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.290
It healed the vessel's 
wounds beautifully

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.860
and fully cleared out 
everything on the inside.

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:25.100
So it would seem.

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:27.940
It was well worth the time 
we spent to obtain him.

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:31.790
Unfortunately, the last gem has 
fallen into Satomi's hands.

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:35.930
It was preordained that all eight 
souls were to gather together.

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:40.250
However, this is a cursed destiny.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.770
These gems represent your eight souls.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:49.130
If we can prevent all of them 
from falling into Satomi's hands,

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.480
that is sufficient.

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:58.590
That man is still alive?

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:01.360
I believe he has already left.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:04.500
I saw him while on our 
way to help you, Shinobu.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:07.600
That man greatly resembled you, Sosuke.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.600
Do you know him?

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:11.700
Meh. It's a long story, 
so let's just say

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:12.850
we've got our ties.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:16.110
Then if I hang out with you 
two, will I run into that man?

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:19.550
I suspect he'll show 
himself sooner or later.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.580
In that case, I'm going to accompany 
you to the Imperial Capital, Shino.

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:25.920
I will avenge Hazuki.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:26.750
Vengeance?

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:29.100
It is a child's job 
to avenge his parent.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.870
Isn't that a given?

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:41.380
What's that?

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:44.640
Hazuki... gave it to me 
the last time I saw him.

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:50.170
Shino, would these 
happen to be the balls

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:51.890
you were talking about?

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:53.410
That's right.

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.650
We've found all eight of them.

00:20:55.650 --> 00:21:00.540
Devotion

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:56.940
Yeah.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:01.170
Integrity

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:01.750
Loyalty

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:02.330
Wisdom

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:02.880
Fraternity

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:03.420
Duty

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:04.210
Compassion

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:08.950
Although my gem is with the shadow!

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:12.300
Do these gems mean anything?

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.950
I'll explain everything later.

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:16.670
Oops!

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:22.330
What would you do if 
you lost another one?

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:23.440
My bad!

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:30.950
Sosuke? Something the matter?

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.430
No, it's nothing.

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.370
Please take good care of this.

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:39.300
Right...

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:40.940
Hey, you ready to go?

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:44.190
How should I go about 
explaining this to Grandma?

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.970
Oh, don't worry about Granny Tae!

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:49.650
She already knows that 
you're a Tengu's kid.

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:50.760
Huh? Seriously?

00:21:50.760 --> 00:21:52.080
Honest to God!

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:41.100
Crossroads

00:23:26.810 --> 00:23:29.460
Hazuki, it's true that you resemble me.

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:30.990
You could say we're mirror 
images of each other.

00:23:30.990 --> 00:23:32.070
So what about it?

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:34.510
But that is no excuse to 
mimic my every movement!

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:35.490
It's disturbing!

00:23:35.490 --> 00:23:36.850
Hey, quit pointing at me!

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:39.850
Kagetsu, why are you 
barking at the mirror?

00:23:39.850 --> 00:23:40.700
Huh?
